### What This Script Does (Complete Flow)

1️⃣ Connects to AWS S3

2️⃣ Downloads:

```
S3/html → /var/www/html
S3/bash → /home/download
```

3️⃣ Deletes removed files (--delete)

4️⃣ Sets ownership:

```
apache:apache
```

5️⃣ Sets permissions:

```
Directories → 755
Files → 644
```

6️⃣ Verifies everything.

