```
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
```

Use IAM Role on EC2 (much safer).

Then remove:

```
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
```

from the script.

